    "label": "10",
    "prompt": "A box of chocolates has 24 chocolates in it. Marie ate $\\frac{1}{2}$ of the box of chocolates and then ate $\\frac{3}{8}$ of the same box of chocolates the next day. What fraction of the box of chocolates did she eat in total?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{7}{8}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{3}{8}&=\\frac{4}{8}+\\frac{3}{8}\\\\\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{3}{8}&=\\frac{7}{8}\\end{align*}$$\nMarie ate $\\frac{7}{8}$ of the box of chocolates in total.",
